### platform-service — direct API calls. Feature flags + idempotency keys.

@platform = http://localhost:5500
@identity = http://localhost:5300
@adminId  = 33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333

### Mint admin token
# @name adminToken
GET {{identity}}/demo/token?role=Admin&userId={{adminId}}
@admin = {{adminToken.response.body.token}}

### List all feature flags for the admin's tenant (Acme)
GET {{platform}}/api/admin/feature-flags
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}

### Set rollout to 100% — Tier 4-style admin endpoint
PUT {{platform}}/api/admin/feature-flags/EnablePremiumBadge/rollout
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "percentage": 100 }

### Toggle the flag — also publishes FeatureFlagToggledIntegrationEvent
POST {{platform}}/api/admin/feature-flags/EnablePremiumBadge/toggle
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "isEnabled": false }

### Opt a specific user in (even when rollout is 0%)
PUT {{platform}}/api/admin/feature-flags/EnablePremiumBadge/users/22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}

### Health
GET {{platform}}/health
